        <div class="tldr">
          <ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 space-y-1">
            <li class="text-[14px] text-ink-2 before:content-['—_'] before:text-accent before:font-semibold">Social proof ads outperform lifestyle and demo ads on trust and conversion rate</li>
            <li class="text-[14px] text-ink-2 before:content-['—_'] before:text-accent before:font-semibold">Demo ads win on product education; lifestyle ads win on brand aspiration</li>
