        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4">Every ad type serves a different function in the conversion journey. Social proof ads answer the question &ldquo;can I trust this?&rdquo; Demo ads answer &ldquo;how does it work?&rdquo; Lifestyle ads answer &ldquo;is this for someone like me?&rdquo; Understanding where each type excels helps you build a balanced creative strategy.</p>

