        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4">Social proof creative must be adapted to each platform&rsquo;s native format and audience expectations. A testimonial that works on TikTok will underperform on YouTube unless it is re-edited for the platform. Here are the formats that work best on each major advertising platform.</p>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border bg-card mb-6">
          <table class="w-full border-collapse text-[14px]">
            <thead class="bg-bg">
              <tr>
