                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink font-medium">YouTube</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink">Case study ads, testimonial compilations</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink">16:9 (1920&times;1080), 60&ndash;120s, or 15s bumper</td>
